cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or toolkit in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "QURAN-NLP: NLP & AI on the Qur'an"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Islam & AI"
    website: "https://islamandai.com"
year: 2023
abstract: >-
  An open-source dataset and toolkit for machine learning and natural-language
  processing on the Qur'an, including the Arabic text, a full morphological
  corpus, multiple English translations and tafaseer, and hundreds of thousands
  of hadiths, plus a zero-dependency Python package for loading and searching
  the data.
keywords:
  - quran
  - nlp
  - arabic
  - islam
  - hadith
  - machine-learning
  - semantic-search
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/islamAndAi/QURAN-NLP"
url: "https://github.com/islamAndAi/QURAN-NLP"
